    "detailed_description": "Being twenty years old and in the prime of youth all seems like a lie.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nA life far from love, lived by someone born into poverty.<br />\r\nRent, food expenses, transportation costs, textbooks, maintenance fees, cell phone bills.<br />\r\nPocket money for younger siblings, and then the student loan repayments after graduation.<br />\r\n<br />\r\n&quot;Am I living my life correctly?&quot;<br />\r\n<br />\r\nIt doesn't seem so.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nRushing to part-time jobs as soon as the lectures end,<br />\r\nand collapsing onto the bed at midnight after a long day.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nBut there's a saying, even every dog has his day.<br />\r\nThen, I receive an offer for a high-paying tutoring job I've only ever heard about...<br />\r\n<br />\r\n<br />\r\n<br />\r\n- Features of the Work<br />\r\n<br />\r\n1) A romance simulation featuring two heroines.<br />\r\n2) Full voice acting by professional voice actors.<br />\r\n3) Enhanced immersion with Full CG and SD CG.",
